From 61384333a80db31f92d3fdfe60aed3eb22c25cdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Andr=C3=A9=20Machado?= <machaddr@falanet.org>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 14:36:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: bq25890: associate supply with firmware node
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Consumers can use the power-supplies property to refer to a charger by its
firmware node.  The bq25890 driver registers its power_supply without that
node, so power_supply_find_supply_from_fwnode() cannot match the reference
and consumers defer forever.

Associate the registered supply with the charger device firmware node.  The
PineTab-V CW2015 gauge can then resolve its SC89890H charger, report the
charging state, and preserve the firmware relationship.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
Signed-off-by: André Machado <machaddr@falanet.org>
---
 drivers/power/supply/bq25890_charger.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/bq25890_charger.c b/drivers/power/supply/bq25890_charger.c
--- a/drivers/power/supply/bq25890_charger.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/bq25890_charger.c
@@ -1125,7 +1125,10 @@ static const struct power_supply_desc bq25890_power_supply_desc = {
 
 static int bq25890_power_supply_init(struct bq25890_device *bq)
 {
-	struct power_supply_config psy_cfg = { .drv_data = bq, };
+	struct power_supply_config psy_cfg = {
+		.drv_data = bq,
+		.fwnode = dev_fwnode(bq->dev),
+	};
 
 	/* Get ID for the device */
 	mutex_lock(&bq25890_id_mutex);
-- 
